async-grpo-tool-use patch for NeMo-RL (https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL), base tag v0.7.0, after 0001 and 0002.
Lets async GRPO (grpo.async_grpo.enabled=true) run with the coreweave_hotload backend: admits the
backend in async_grpo_train, lets in-flight rollouts continue through a hot-load, and fails the
job when the async loop or its first refit fails, instead of exiting 0. At the end it waits for
the hot-loads still running in the background (hotload_cfg.max_versions_behind) and fails on their error.
Applied by async_grpo_tool_use/run_trainer.py with `git apply`, which skips this header.
Upstream code: Apache-2.0, NVIDIA CORPORATION.

